Package "kb:computer-braille@0.1.0"

DefType state {held: u16 chord: u16}
DefType output {state: state usage: u8 modifiers: u8}

Export {iface: "kb:firmware/braille@0.1.0" name: map-cell params: {cell: u16} result: u32}
